AnimScript←{
   ⍝ The script element of the animated SVG
   ⍝ ⍺ is FPS NFRAMES JD1 SKIP; ⍵ is LAT LONG TIME, and the planet data as JSON
    lat long t←3↑⍵
    data←⍺ AnimScriptData ⍵
    tables←AnimScriptTables t lat long
    '<script type="text/javascript"><![CDATA[(function(){',data,(AnimScriptSky ⍬),tables,(AnimScriptPlayback ⍬),(AnimScriptTips ⍬),'})();]]></script>' }
